graph LR
    WVA["Workload Variant<br/>Autoscaler Operator"]

    %% External Dependencies
    WVA -->|saturation metrics<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer or mTLS| Prometheus["Prometheus"]
    WVA -->|resource mgmt<br/>HTTPS :6443| KubeAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>v1.34+"]
    WVA -->|operator framework<br/>v0.22.5| ControllerRuntime["controller-runtime"]
    WVA -->|InferencePool CRD<br/>v1 + v1alpha2| GatewayAPIExt["Gateway API<br/>Inference Extension<br/>v1.2.1"]
    WVA -->|ScaledObject watch<br/>(optional)| KEDA["KEDA<br/>v2.18.0"]
    WVA -->|LeaderWorkerSet<br/>scale targets| LWS["LeaderWorkerSet<br/>v0.8.0"]
    WVA -->|Kalman filtering| KalmanFilter["llm-inferno<br/>kalman-filter<br/>v0.1.2"]
    WVA -->|numerical<br/>computation| Gonum["gonum<br/>v0.17.0"]

    %% Internal RHOAI Dependencies
    WVA -->|ServiceMonitor CRD| PromOperator["Prometheus<br/>Operator<br/>v0.89.0"]

    %% Actuation Targets
    WVA -->|Scale subresource| Deployments["Deployments"]
    WVA -->|Scale subresource| LeaderWorkerSets["LeaderWorkerSets"]

    %% Observability
    WVA -->|metrics client| PromClient["prometheus<br/>client_golang<br/>v1.23.2"]
    WVA -->|structured logging| Zap["go.uber.org/zap<br/>v1.27.1"]
    WVA -->|config mgmt| Viper["spf13/viper<br/>v1.21.0"]

    %% Runtime
    WVA -->|LRU caching| LRU["golang-lru/v2<br/>v2.0.7"]

